{
  "readme": {
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Rachis (QIIME 2) plugin for computing prevalence-abundance core scores from\nrelative-frequency feature tables."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "How the core score is calculated"
          }
        ],
        "identifier": "how-the-core-score-is-calculated",
        "label": "How the core score is calculated",
        "html_id": "how-the-core-score-is-calculated",
        "implicit": true
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "For each feature, q2-core combines how consistently the feature occurs across\nsamples with how abundant it is:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "start": 1,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Prevalence"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " is the fraction of samples in which the feature’s relative\nabundance is strictly greater than "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "min_rel_abundance"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " (default: "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "0.001"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ")."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Mean relative abundance"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " is calculated across all samples by default. If\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "mean_abundance_on_presence=True"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ", the mean instead uses only samples where\nthe feature exceeds "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "min_rel_abundance"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "The mean abundance is transformed as\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "log10(mean_abundance + offset)"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ", where "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "offset"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " (default: "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "1e-6"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": ") prevents\ntaking the logarithm of zero."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Prevalence and log-transformed mean abundance are each min--max scaled to\nthe interval "
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "[0, 1]"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " across all features in the input table."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": true,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "The final score is their product:\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "inlineCode",
                "value": "core_score = scaled_prevalence * scaled_log_mean_abundance"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Consequently, a high score identifies features that are both widespread and\nrelatively abundant. Features with a low value for either component receive a\nlow score. Scores are relative to the features in the supplied table; if all\nfeatures have the same value for either component, that component is set to\nzero for every feature."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The output contains the unscaled and scaled component values as\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "prevalence"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "mean_abundance"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "log_mean_abundance"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "prevalence_scaled"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", and\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "log_mean_abundance_scaled"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", in addition to "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "core_score"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Installation"
          }
        ],
        "identifier": "installation",
        "label": "Installation",
        "html_id": "installation",
        "implicit": true
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Please follow the installation instructions on\nthe "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "url": "https://library.qiime2.org/plugins/bokulich-lab/q2-core",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "QIIME 2 Library"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", to\ninstall an env with the QIIME 2 or MOSHPIT distros and q2-core."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 2,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Usage"
          }
        ],
        "identifier": "usage",
        "label": "Usage",
        "html_id": "usage",
        "implicit": true
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Python API"
          }
        ],
        "identifier": "python-api",
        "label": "Python API",
        "html_id": "python-api",
        "implicit": true
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "",
        "value": "rel_frequency_table = Artifact.load(\"path-to-table\")\n\ncore_scores = core.actions.score(\n    table=rel_frequency_table,\n    min_rel_abundance=0.001,\n    mean_abundance_on_presence=True,\n)\ncore_scores_artifact = core_scores.core_scores\ncore_scores_artifact.save(\"output_path_core_score\")\n\nfiltered_table = feature_table.actions.filter_features(\n    table=rel_frequency_table,\n    metadata=core_scores_artifact.view(Metadata),\n    where=\"core_score > 0.01\",\n    max_frequency=\"None\",\n)\nfiltered_rel_frequency_table = filtered_table.filtered_table\nfiltered_rel_frequency_table.save(\"output_path_filtered_table\")"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "CLI"
          }
        ],
        "identifier": "cli",
        "label": "CLI",
        "html_id": "cli",
        "implicit": true
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "",
        "value": "qiime core score \\\n  --i-table rel_frequency_table.qza \\\n  --p-min-rel-abundance 0.001 \\\n  --p-mean-abundance-on-presence \\\n  --o-core-scores core_scores.qza\n\nqiime feature-table filter-features \\\n  --i-table rel_frequency_table.qza \\\n  --m-metadata-file core_scores.qza \\\n  --p-where 'core_score > 0.01' \\\n  --o-filtered-table filtered_rel_frequency_table.qza"
      }
    ]
  },
